# Hardware (KiCad v1)

- Source of truth is `hardware/kicad/gen_sch.py`. **Edit that, then regenerate.**
  Never hand-edit `*.kicad_sch`.
- Do **not** Read/Grep bulk `*.kicad_sch`, `cof-v1.pdf`, `_preview/*`, or large SVGs/PNGs.
  Use `kicad-cli sch erc` and short greps instead.
- Do **not** regenerate `_preview` SVG/PNG tiles unless the user asks to look at a
  layout image.
- After `gen_sch.py`: `sch upgrade` the three sheets, `sch erc`, `sch export pdf`.
  Skip SVG export by default.
- Prefer labels over long wires; never route across IC bodies (rules in `gen_sch.py`).
- Hardware v1.4 is frozen. GPIO map: `docs/hardware/HARDWARE_V1.md` §10.
